{
  "__comment": "Parity fixture for everframe-vtree-v1. Consumed by TS (this repo), Swift (sdk-ios, Phase 22), Kotlin (sdk-android, Phase 23), and the dashboard VTreePlayer (Phase 25). All must decode → re-encode → equal the canonical (sorted-key) JSON. The per-node redaction-strip flag is intentionally absent in v1 (a v2-additive field).",
  "__semantics": "id is a stable per-node handle, unique within the timeline, persisting across frames; diffing is id-keyed, NEVER index-keyed. children[] order == paint order (LAST child on top — same as find-path-at.json). frame is logical points {x,y,w,h}, top-left origin; viewport.scale carries device density. frame 0 carries the full snapshot; to render frame N apply frames[0..N].ops in order against a mutable copy keyed by id. set = partial-attr patch (absent field == unchanged). add = embedded subtree at insert index. remove = by id.",
